    "sceneHistory": [],
    "messages": [
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:15",
        "eventSequence": 5,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“现在只有两人报名。我已经准备好一篇自己就能读完的短篇，不过也有点担心，场面小会让你失望。\n\n我想先商量一个小场的办法：愿意读的人读，也允许只来听。你不用因为来讨论，就承担主持或上台的任务。告示暂时不改，这还只是个提议。\n\n你对这样的朗读夜有什么期待？”",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:5613f512-345a-41f7-8e9d-a97e171b6b76",
        "eventSequence": 6,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "嗯，我在听。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:16",
        "eventSequence": 8,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“嗯，那我把设想说具体一点：先由我读准备好的短篇，读完留一点自愿交流的时间。想只听、不发言的人，也可以安静听完。\n\n我觉得，小场也可以有完整的内容，不一定非得热闹。这还是个待商量的流程，不给你安排任务，告示也先不改。”",
        "replyToSequence": 6,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:e2ce6b96-cd3a-4811-816a-471505e1947f",
        "eventSequence": 9,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "你接着说。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:17",
        "eventSequence": 11,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "许听澜从公告板下的用品盒里取出替换纸和粗字笔，写下一份草稿：“朗读夜参与说明——讨论稿，尚未确定：可以只来听，不必朗读；拟由许听澜读一篇已准备好的短篇，之后自愿交流，也可以不发言。”她把草稿放在一旁，没有替换原告示。\n\n“我想补清楚的是参加方式，不是把场面写得更热闹。这张先作为讨论稿，你接着听，不代表你已经同意这些安排。”",
        "replyToSequence": 9,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:9a6cab64-ddf0-447d-970f-4a41b0bcf311",
        "eventSequence": 12,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "我想听听你的想法。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:18",
        "eventSequence": 14,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“我的想法是，值得参加不一定等于坐满六把椅子。哪怕最后还是两人报名，我也更倾向于办：有人认真读，也有人能自在地听，就有意义。\n\n短篇朗读是我愿意承担的部分；但我不想为了显得内容丰富，再给你添任务。比起继续扩充流程，我更想把这一篇读好，让来的人不觉得被催着表现。\n\n这是我的取舍，还不是我们共同定下的安排，也不是更换告示的决定。”",
        "replyToSequence": 12,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:5f339703-04a5-400e-9171-51c1e2d0fc62",
        "eventSequence": 15,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "嗯，我在听。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:19",
        "eventSequence": 17,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“嗯。那这份讨论稿，你赞成把它补进正式告示吗——可以只来听，不必朗读；拟由我读准备好的短篇，之后自愿交流，也可以不发言。你也可以提出想改的地方，或者暂时不定。”",
        "replyToSequence": 15,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:a056f391-dc6e-4c30-8ee1-dbd03602fb5c",
        "eventSequence": 18,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "我还没有决定，你可以先说说顾虑。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:20",
        "eventSequence": 20,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“我有点担心，即使补清楚了参加方式，最后还是只有两人报名，你会觉得这一晚太单薄。但我也不知道，报名少是不是因为告示没写明白；补上说明，不等于就能多招到人。\n\n这份草稿对我最重要的意义，是让人知道可以只听，而不是把活动写得更热闹。我准备好的是那篇短篇，比起往告示上添更多环节，我更在意写出来的内容是不是自己真能承担。\n\n你还没决定，我不把这些顾虑当成催你点头的理由。”",
        "replyToSequence": 18,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:f0b6100a-2ff0-48b4-9f30-71ea875a16de",
        "eventSequence": 21,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "你接着说。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:21",
        "eventSequence": 23,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“再说下去，恐怕还是在绕着‘人少会不会单薄’打转。我想换个更具体的办法：你愿意先听我准备的短篇里的一小段吗？听听内容，再看看这样的朗读夜有没有意思。告示怎么改，仍然可以先不决定。”",
        "replyToSequence": 21,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:3eb424ec-c3b0-417e-8b92-eade30b85171",
        "eventSequence": 24,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "我还没有决定，你可以先说说顾虑。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:22",
        "eventSequence": 26,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“对刚才的试读提议，我有个顾虑：我怕自己太在意你的评价，把分享一小段变成了请你替整场活动把关，甚至安慰我。\n\n我希望听到真实的感受，但不想让你觉得，听了就得说好，或者得帮我保证活动有意思。你还没决定，现在就先不开始试读。”",
        "replyToSequence": 24,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:7ec96e83-2f3b-4d7e-a700-bc4562d476ce",
        "eventSequence": 27,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "我想听听你的想法。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:23",
        "eventSequence": 29,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“我想先把准备落在自己能做的事上：独自练练那篇短篇的开场和收尾，看看怎样读得从容，怎样结束得自然，而不是靠增加环节撑场面。\n\n这件事不需要你先试听或替活动把关。至于正式安排，我还是倾向于简单一点：我读一篇，来的人可以只听。你可以有不同的想法；现在这仍是我的提议，不是我们已经定下来的方案。”",
        "replyToSequence": 27,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:24",
        "eventSequence": 31,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "许听澜压低声音，独自把已准备短篇的开场和收尾各练了一遍，在收尾处留了一次停顿。她没有要求玩家试听或评价，也没有改动告示。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:25",
        "eventSequence": 33,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“我的想法先说到这里。安排还没定，不急着现在答复。”\n\n许听澜安静下来，没有接着劝说，也没有开始面向玩家的试读。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:52fae5a5-788f-40ed-9c14-1d7f4511e2f3",
        "eventSequence": 34,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "嗯，我在听。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:26",
        "eventSequence": 36,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“我说了不少自己的顾虑，也想听听你的想法：只有两人报名的这场朗读夜，你有没有特别在意、想先聊清楚的地方？不一定是担心，也可以是你觉得最值得保留的部分。告示和试听都不急着决定。”",
        "replyToSequence": 34,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:f51c58fc-c295-4432-b1ca-21c8bb624083",
        "eventSequence": 37,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "你接着说。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:27",
        "eventSequence": 39,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“还有收尾这件事，我倾向于留一个简单的备选：短篇读完，如果没人想交流，可以由我简短致谢，结束这一晚，不硬凑一轮发言。\n\n我希望安静也能是一个自然的结尾，而不是非得有人接话才算办成。这个办法不需要给你安排救场的任务。不过，它还只是供我们讨论的提议，没有定进流程。”",
        "replyToSequence": 37,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:d0dcbfe3-d73b-46ae-88a2-e1c156f562b8",
        "eventSequence": 40,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "我想听听你的想法。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      }
    ],
