            "origin": "reviewed-world",
            "sourceEventSequence": 0,
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": "chat-source.4f397a86a558aca8f0505c103b3285d959bda8a128b1d2ae54e6df8492378861.0",
            "text": "\"她已准备了一个可以由自己独自读完的短篇，但担心小场面让玩家失望。\""
          },
          {
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "factKey": "world-fact.0002",
            "origin": "reviewed-world",
            "sourceEventSequence": 0,
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": "chat-source.4f397a86a558aca8f0505c103b3285d959bda8a128b1d2ae54e6df8492378861.3",
            "text": "\"与玩家约好讨论朗读夜安排的旧书店店主\""
          },
          {
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "factKey": "world-fact.0003",
            "origin": "reviewed-world",
            "sourceEventSequence": 0,
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": "chat-source.4f397a86a558aca8f0505c103b3285d959bda8a128b1d2ae54e6df8492378861.6",
            "text": "\"许听澜\""
          },
          {
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "factKey": "world-fact.0004",
            "origin": "reviewed-world",
            "sourceEventSequence": 0,
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": "chat-source.4f397a86a558aca8f0505c103b3285d959bda8a128b1d2ae54e6df8492378861.11",
            "text": "\"活动定在两天后，书店的桌椅可以容纳六个人。目前只有两人报名，活动尚未取消。玩家曾答应一起讨论安排，没有承诺主持、出钱或上台。店门口的公告板由书店自己管理，允许修改自己的活动告示。\""
          },
          {
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "factKey": "local-1-notice",
            "origin": "author-private",
            "sourceEventSequence": 0,
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": null,
            "text": "门口现有的朗读夜告示写着活动日期、活动名称和报名方式，没有说明参加者是否必须朗读，也没有介绍现场会怎样进行；这些文字在店内一侧即可读到。"
          },
          {
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "factKey": "local-1-editable",
            "origin": "author-private",
            "sourceEventSequence": 0,
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": null,
            "text": "这张告示装在可开启的透明夹板里，书店自用的替换纸和粗字笔就在公告板下的用品盒中；许听澜可以取用。"
          },
          {
            "factKey": "notice-discussion-draft-1",
            "text": "许听澜从公告板下的用品盒里取出替换纸和粗字笔，写下一份草稿：“朗读夜参与说明——讨论稿，尚未确定：可以只来听，不必朗读；拟由许听澜读一篇已准备好的短篇，之后自愿交流，也可以不发言。”她把草稿放在一旁，没有替换原告示。",
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "origin": "runtime-consequence",
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": null,
            "sourceEventSequence": 11
          },
          {
            "factKey": "reading-practice-1",
            "text": "许听澜压低声音，独自把已准备短篇的开场和收尾各练了一遍，在收尾处留了一次停顿。她没有要求玩家试听或评价，也没有改动告示。",
            "audienceKeys": [
              "player",
              "participant.001"
            ],
            "origin": "runtime-consequence",
            "sourceKnowledgeKey": null,
            "sourceEventSequence": 31
          }
        ],
        "goals": [
